Description: Qt 6 + Kirigami application launcher
 GoshLauncher opens with Ctrl+Space and searches URLs, paths, folders,
 bookmarks, apps, calculator, units, color, clock, windows, system actions,
 Settings panels, recent files, and the web last unless @. Built with
 Qt 6 and KDE Kirigami, following the system light/dark color scheme.
 See https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/spotlight-goshos
